#313: FILE: drivers/char/proxy.c:182:
+	kobject_set_name(&(px_cdev.kobj), "proxy%d", px_devicenumber);

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

